    {
      "title": "At least seven dead after landslip in Mumbai’s Kurla; rescue efforts under way",
      "link": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/cities/mumbai/kurla-landslide-in-mumbai-death-toll-bmc-ndrf-rescue-efforts-august-12-2026/article71334944.ece",
